(97959,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Lodestone. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70450),
(97965,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own First Aid Kit. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70291),
(97968,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Incense Candle. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70245),
(97970,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Lodestone. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70235),
(97971,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70245),
(97977,'Oh, it\'s even worse than I thought.$B$BThese engravings tell us that the Gnarlpine began having nightmares of being wiped out by some great shadow. Before long, that fear turned to rage--and the shadow to their former elven friends. To be aware of your own mind slipping away from you...$B$BOur only hope is that this may help us better understand what is happening on Teldrassil. Thank you for your aid, $N.',70790),
(97979,'You have seen what our goddess provides. Use it well, and she will never forsake you.',70790),
(98024,'What\'s this? An elf? And you say the Warchief sent you?$B$B<Thork grunts sharply as he looks you up and down.>$B$BYou look a little skinny to me, but it matters not. Out here you\'ll either thrive and survive, or you\'ll die. That is the way of things in these lands.',70790),
(98046,'Do not mind the Arch Druid, $N. He bears the weight of much in Malfurion\'s absence.$B$BWait! Some drops yet remain in the phial! Perhaps that is why his incantation failed?',70790),
(98065,'Staghelm has done much in my beloved\'s absence, but he is not Malfurion. And he does not run the affairs of Darnassus--that burden is mine alone.$B$B<Tyrande\'s face settles.>$B$BI apologize. As you have likely seen, we have many challenges to overcome.$B$BFandral is Arch Druid for now, and I ask you respect his station. But his doings pertain to druidism, and mine not only to Elune but indeed to lead our people as she wills.$B$BEvery drop of this water is blessed by our goddess. I thank you for saving it.',70790),
(98069,'Thank you, $N. These supplies will help get us through until the next shipment arrives.',70862),
(98093,'Thank you for helping me out, $N. I\'ll let Camp Taurajo know you were able to rescue me. I\'m so lucky you helped, I could have been stuck there all day!$B$BThis is all I have to spare, but I hope it\'s useful to you.$B$BI\'ll be making my exit once I make the careful climb down.',70862),
(98094,'Quaint. A fresh face for the field work.$B$BWell, let\'s see what you have then.',70862),
(98248,'You found the right place, and you\'re speaking with the right person! I can jot you down as one of our new associates. No paperwork necessary on your part, I can\'t be bothered with more of that.$B$BAll we ask of you is to assist in dealing with compromised deliveries you find during your travels. Doing so will earn you Merchant\'s Favor, which you can use to purchase goods and services right here. Here\'s a bit to get you settled in!$B$BDo you happen to have the crate this label came with?',70862),
(98251,'Ha! That\'s right, you beasts!$B$BThanks. That does seem to already have helped.',70862),
(98252,'<You hear the voice of Va\'xug echoing from within the floating eye.>$B$B"Was it that simple? No matter. This vision will assist me in wrangling my unruly Voidwalker along the correct trail when I resummon him. Thank you, traveler. Cut through this forest with sure steps."$B$B<The Eye of Kilrogg begins to dissipate.>',70862),
(98298,'It appears I get the last laugh after all, haha! Arugal truly was a fool. And I, Dalar Dawnweaver, have exposed him as the fraud he is.$B$BThese pieces are all the proof I need that the curse has nothing to do with that blithering dolt.$B$BRegrettably, that means his remedy is also worth nothing. It seems the search for a solution to the worgen curse continues.',70862),
(98340,'And so it continues, Father Cenarius.$B$B<Dendrite makes a quick, invisible gesture in the air above him. A slight aura of power falls over him.>$B$BGreetings again, $N. It is time for you to learn the next perspective of nature: the cat. I will put you on the path to understanding this aspect of druidic life, but much like the bear, it is you that must embrace this learning and propagate it.',70790),
(98341,'Greetings, young shen\'dorei. I have come to you because I sense you are ready to undertake the trial to determine if you understand my spiritual nature or not.$B$BI will have you take the trial of the Great Cat Spirit of Azeroth, but as you are from Zephras, I wished to oversee your progress myself. After all, it is my shape you would take, not that of an Azerothian cat spirit.$B$BLet us begin.',70790),
(98362,'Welcome back, $N. I can sense you have met with the Great Cat Spirit and have successfully completed the trial. All druids must pass a trial given by this spirit, though the trials vary by generation. I am proud you have passed and have heeded the wisdom of the Great Cat Spirit. It is an ancient spirit that is as deadly as it is playful, though I can sense you understand the spirit\'s nature already.$B$BI will now instruct you on how to take the shape of the cat.',70790),
(98387,'Excellent work, $N. With the Blackrock orcs cut off from their allies in the Burning Steppes, they will have no hope of maintaining their foothold here without proper supplies.',70450),
(98389,'May this help Executor Arren and so many others see our true nature. Much like in our past lives, we live to serve our people--to protect them with the gifts the Light provides us.$B$BThey will see in time that we are just as valuable to the Dark Lady\'s plans as any other.$B$BLight be with you.',70862),
(98391,'I am glad you arrived so quickly. The Sisterhood requires your aid.',70790),
(98404,'Excellent. You have shown you understand the true nature of the cat, and are able to embody the cunning, stealth, and ferocity needed to take my shape.$B$BI now deem you worthy of my blessing, young $c.',70790),
(98407,'Quite the armful you have.$B$BWhile this doesn\'t solve our problem out here, I can rest comfortably knowing we\'ve discouraged them pushing any further. Great work, $N.',70862),
(98423,'Ah yes, my ancestor Madoran was the first Bronzebeard king of Ironforge following the great civil war between the Wildhammer, Bronzebeard, and Dark Iron clans. This treaty was drafted to codify the cessation of hostilities and terms of peace after the Bronzebeards won the mountain.$B$BAs you can see, the Wildhammers and Bronzebeards signed it... and the Dark Irons did not.$B$BThank you for recovering this and bringing it to me, $c.',70338),
(98512,'I\'m glad you made it back. That group of Al\'Aketh looked like stone cold killers. $B$BThank you for your aid, I\'ll include your assistance in my report when I return to Valanaar.',70790),
(98545,'Thanks for delivering this, pal.$B$BWait... he said I\'d tip you? I didn\'t agree to that! $B$BFine. Take your pick of this junk in the lost and found. You\'d be surprised how many of these Forsaken leave their stuff laying around after getting haircuts. There\'s a joke here about them being brainless, but I suspect in a lot of cases it might actually be true.',70790),
(98575,'You have just glimpsed the power that can be yours. The feeble and foolish among us are afraid of the path that we tread, but with boldness and cunning we can decide our own fates.$B$BGuard your powers closely. The fearful lash out against that which they do not understand.$B$BNow you are one of us. If you need training in spells then return to me.',70790),
(98601,'Your training can now begin in earnest, $c. I see great promise in you, but take care not to turn away from the light, even for a moment. Embrace the pain it will cause you. That pain is a crucible, and you will emerge from it stronger than you ever were in your previous life.',70334),
(98738,'<Dendrite makes another invisible gesture in the air above him as you approach. Another aura of power comes over him, and he smiles ever so slightly.>$B$BI sense the cunning and ferocity of the cat within you that was not present when I sent you to meet the Great Cat Spirit. In your eyes I can sense you now understand the stealth and speed needed to adopt this nature.$B$BNow you may learn to focus your cunning and adopt the true nature of the cat and call upon its spirit.',70790),
(98823,'Ah... this shard hums with the voice of the world itself. The light within is a memory from the past, glimmering with flashes of history. This titan machine must have been waiting to be understood for lifetimes.$B$BYou\'ve done wisely to bring it to us. The Earthen Ring will safeguard it, study it, and share the truths it keeps when we are able to receive its messages.$B$BYou honor the elements today, traveler.',70862),
(99046,'Elune\'s grace... I shall not die... alone...',70790),
(99047,'The harpies have become afflicted by the same foulness showing up throughout the forest. I\'m sure that is what ails Sentinel Eralya as well.$B$BWe must hurry. It won\'t be long before she succumbs to her injuries.',70790),
(99048,'Heglan\'s body lies cold within the wreckage of the hut.$B$BWhatever killed her doesn\'t seem to be human. There may be signs of what happened nearby.',70840),
(99049,'This banner and blade piece belong to the naga! They must have come down the coast from the north.$B$BWe cannot let them establish a foothold here. The pressure from both directions would be too much for Razor Hill.',70840),
(99051,'Hopefully that sends them packing back to the north. I\'ll have some grunts keep an eye out for any stragglers or funny business.',70862),
(99052,'Ha! I could hear his body fall from here!$B$BBe proud of your kill today; not many can claim they survived a fight with a sea giant.',70862),
(99123,'Ah, Pal\'juh got herself in trouble again, did she?$B$BHopefully she learns her lesson about going alone this time. Thank you for helping her. She\'s a promising $c, just tends to act more like a raptor than a tiger.',70840),
(99134,'There are precious few delights afforded to us in death. Thankfully, pain is chief among them.$B$BYou please me this day, and therefore you please the Dark Lady. Perhaps you can be of further use.',70862),
(99141,'I should have known better than to think an abomination could write anything of use. Let us keep that lapse of judgment between us.$B$BYou have pleased me, and therefore pleased the Dark Lady. Perhaps there is hope for you.',70862),
(99142,'Most glorious indeed!$B$B<Junior Apothecary Holland inspects the weeds.>$B$BHmm, I had hoped they would have matured a bit more violently. Nevertheless, progress is progress!$B$BA great many will die as a result of your actions this day. You should be proud.',70245),
(99152,'Well done, $c. With these bones we may be able to better understand how such a threat was able to go unnoticed for so long.',70245),
(99153,'Well done--and quick, too! Now onto my favorite part...',70245),
(99156,'You are a testament to the cunning and coordination that all Forsaken possess--something the mindless Scourge will never have.$B$BPlease accept this as thanks for your efforts, as promised.',70862),
(99260,'Thank you for saving Fillion, $N. I\'m sure he told you how vital the data he was sent to retrieve is.$B$BWithout that data, our prospects for opening safe lanes of travel to Azeroth are in serious jeopardy. Our spies tell us that the Windshapers have themselves procured the means to traverse the planes, and no doubt wish to jealously guard this secret.$B$BAs ever, their own dogmatic hubris takes precedence over the good of our people. They are little better than the Al\'Aketh.',70245);
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`)
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(2,'Yes, mighty $c, I sensed your arrival.  I trust you have more news to report to me about your hunt?',70862),
(8,'Yes? Yes? What is it?$B$BThe forsaken; they certainly do have huge appetites. Make yourself at home... yes, rest those weary bones. My name\'s Renee if you need anything at all.',70862),
(11,'Hail, $N.  Have you been killing Gnolls...?',70862),
(12,'Perhaps I did not make myself clear, pledge.  In order to prove your worth as a servant to The People\'s Militia and to the Light you need to slay 15 Defias Trappers and 15 Defias Smugglers then return to me when the deed is done.',70790),
(18,'Have you gathered those bandanas for me yet?',70790),
(20,'Have you been slaying orcs, $N?  If so, then show me...',70450),
(22,'All I need for my famous meat pie are 8 Goretusk Livers!',70862),
(23,'Ah - $N - I was just thinking about you!  How goes your hunting?',70862),
(24,'Greetings once again, $N!  Have you come to show me proof of your hunt?',70862),
(30,'Have you formed your pendant for me to inspect, $N?  If you need help in locating the parts, try asking the local populace for information.  Not only will you find what you seek, but it will give you a reason to explore this wondrous and sacred glade.',70790),
(31,'Your return to Thunder Bluff is not without heralding, though I will need proof of your lessons learned in Moonglade before I will teach you your aquatic form.$B$BDo you have the Pendant of the Sea Lion?',70790),
(33,'Hey $N.  I\'m getting hungry...did you get that tough wolf meat?',70790),
(34,'Is Bellygrub still at it or were you able to rid Lakeshire of the pest once and for all?',70862),
(36,'I\'m going to miss that Verna Furlbrow so much.  I don\'t suppose you happened to see her on your way here?',70862),
(38,'Come back with the following ingredients: $B $B 3 Stringy Vulture Meat $B 3 Goretusk Snouts $B 3 Murloc Eyes $B 3 Okra',70862),
(46,'How goes the hunting, $N?',70862),
(47,'Psst!  You have that Gold Dust for me...for me?',70790),
(52,'Have you killed those wolves and bears?',70790),
(54,'You have word from McBride?  Northshire is a garden compared to Elwynn Forest, but I wonder what Marshal McBride has to report.$B$BHere, let me have his papers...',70790),
(59,'I have been commissioned by the Stormwind Army to supply their people with cloth and leather armor.$B$BIf you have a marker for me, then I\'d be happy to make you something.',70790),
(60,'Did you gather those candles yet?',70790),
(61,'Oh, a shipment from my brother?  Splendid!  Fortune truly shines on me today!',70790),
(63,'The brazier still reflects the ambient light from the area, and the flame shifts slightly as you move closer.$B$BThe corruption along the hills seems to have kept its distance, and besides the missing components, the brazier looks prepared for the ritual to summon a cleansed manifestation of water.',70862),
(64,'Don\'t suppose you were able to get my watch?',70862),
(71,'Hello, $N.  Have you discovered the fates of Rolf and Malakai?',70790),
(83,'I\'m running low on linen, $N.  Do you have any for me?',70790),
(84,'Ugh... I\'m starving!  Do you have that pie for me, $N?',70862),
(86,'I don\'t think it\'s right feeding the boy who stole my necklace in the first place, but if that\'s what it takes to get back what\'s mine, then so be it!$B$BDo you have that boar meat?',70862),
(96,'You\'ve returned. Splendid!$B$BHow went your journey to Silverpine? Did it take you long?$B$BIt is hard for me to tell if you were successful there because so much of the land has become corrupt. Its stench overwhelms any good that you might have done. But small successes are sometimes as important as large ones. Purifying the water there was instrumental for you, and for all shamans.',70862),
(99,'Have you secured the Pyrewood Shackles yet, $N?',70862),
(102,'Have you collected 8 paws from those treacherous Gnolls yet?',70862),
(106,'You have what??  Maybell is the light of my dull life.  Hurry, let me see her letter!',70862),
(117,'Hurry, my friend, move with haste $BIn order for our rich lager to taste$BMore like beer and less like stew,$BHops are needed to make the brew.',70862),
(120,'What have you there?',70862),
(121,'Did the General send news?  Are reinforcements on the way?',70862),
(123,'What?!?  We haven\'t had our people working the Elwynn mines for months!$B$BLet me see that note you have...',70862),
(127,'You have some sunfish for me, eh?',70450),
(129,'Darcy sent me a lunch, did she?  Such a kind heart she has.  Well...let\'s have it!',70862),
(131,'Hello again, $N.  Did Parker like the lunch I sent him?',70862),
(132,'Good to see you back, $N.  What did Wiley have to say for himself?',70862),
(135,'What business do you have with me?  I am a very busy man. . .',70862),
(141,'Did Master Shaw shed any light on things?',70862),
(142,'$N, were you able to gather any information?  Did you locate the messenger?',70862),
(147,'Did you find the Collector?  Did you discover whom he\'s working for?',70862),
(150,'Do you have those fins?  Hurry, we need those murlocs driven from the lake!',70450),
(151,'Old Blanchy is on her last leg.  Did you happen to find any oats for her?',70862),
(153,'Bring me 15 red leather bandanas and I\'ll pay you well.',70862),
(156,'Hi, $N.  Do you have those rot blossoms for me yet?',70450),
(166,'How goes the hunt for Edwin VanCleef?',70862),
(176,'Yes, Hogger has been a real pain for me and my men.  You have something to report about the beast?',70790),
(184,'You have the deed to my farm??  That\'s good news!  Some ruffians stole it days ago... I thought it was gone for good!$B$BPlease, let me have it.  We\'re on our way out of Westfall and ain\'t coming back any time soon, but if we do then we\'ll need those papers...',70862),
(201,'Well? Did you have any luck in locating the camp?',70862),
(214,'Have you been reclaiming our land from the Defias gang?  If so show me 10 Red Silk Bandanas as proof.',70862),
(220,'Hello again, $N. You\'re looking well.$B$BWhat brings you back to me so soon?',70862),
(264,'The stone is cold to the touch,  but has obviously been abused. Trash litters the area; nicks and gashes decorate the relief atop the coffin; and the foliage around the grave has started to grow over the site.$B$BNo one cares for whoever is buried here, especially not any victims of the plague.',70790),
(267,'Do you have 8 Trogg Stone Teeth to show me?  If not, there is still work to be done, $N.',70338),
(307,'Do you have that Miners\' Gear, $N?',70338),
(308,'Hmph! There is all this booze down here, but I have strict orders not to touch it. If only I could get a taste of some of our Thunder Ale...that would sharpen my wits, no lying!',70338),
(310,'The date on this barrel shows that it\'ll soon be tapped.',70338),
(311,'Did you make the switch?',70338),
(315,'Do you have that shimmerweed?  I almost have a batch of stout ready to brew, and I want to try throwing the weed in with this mixture.',70338),
(332,'Greetings and welcome, master.  Have you yet tried one of our fine wines?',70291),
(333,'You bring word from Mr. Bagley?',70291),
(353,'You come all the way from Stormwind?  I hear it\'s getting dicey down there in the $r lands, with brigands and orcs running about.  A perfect place for a $c to prove their worth!',70862),
(354,'Do you have the remains of the Agamands?  Are those cursed beasts finally destroyed?',70862),
(356,'Do you have a report of your patrol?',70862),
(357,'$N, have you acquired the book?',70790),
(358,'Is your task complete?  Have you destroyed those dog-things and drained them of their ichor?',70862),
(361,'Yes?',70862),
(362,'Did you find Devlin?',70862),
(365,'Deathguard Simmer sent word that you were going to provide me with some much needed reagents.  Were you able to gather 10 pumpkins yet, $N?',70862),
(366,'Your masters are fools to send you here, for I will never again be a Scourge slave!',70790),
(367,'Have you collected 5 vials of darkhound blood yet, $N? Time is fleeting!',70862),
(368,'$N, were you able to obtain 5 Vile Fin Scales from the Murlocs?',70862),
(369,'Do you have some venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider yet, $N?  It\'s the final component I need in order to test my experiment.',70790),
(373,'Yes? Is there something I can help you with?',70862),
(374,'Have you collected 10 Scarlet Insignia Rings yet, $c?',70790),
(375,'Do you have five Duskbat Pelts and some Coarse Thread yet, $N?',70862),
(376,'Do try your best to keep yourself unharmed until I get you some armor.',70862),
(381,'Those fools... They happily send themselves to their own graves.',70862),
(382,'How goes your mission, $N?',70862),
(383,'Yes, what do you want?',70862),
(398,'Yes?',70862),
(399,'$N! Did you have any luck?',70862),
(404,'Have you completed the task with which I have charged you?  Do you have those putrid claws?',70862),
(405,'Greetings.  Either you do not know who I am, or your business with me is urgent.$B$BBecause if neither of these were true, then you would not be foolish enough to disturb me...',70862),
(407,'Stay away, foul and unholy creature!  May the Light protect me!  The Scarlet Crusade shall rid Azeroth of your. . .$B$B. . .oh wait.  Is that food for me?  I am so hungry. . .',70862),
(408,'Time is not a luxury we have, $N.  With each passing hour, the Scourge\'s hold on Tirisfal Glades grows more firm.',70790),
(410,'This is an old, beaten, bloody table.',70790),
(411,'Have you returned Gunther\'s book?  Has he responded?',70790),
(412,'The Recombobulator will be up and running as soon as we have sufficient Restabilization Cogs and Gyromechanic Gears.',70338),
(413,'Hello, $C!  And what business takes you all the way out here?$B$BSomething exciting, I hope.  I haven\'t been in a good fight in days, and this barrel of ale is almost dry...',70338),
(414,'Greetings, $C, and welcome to Thelsamar!',70338),
(416,'Hail, $N.  How goes the rat catching?',70338),
(418,'I\'m all ready to start cooking, do you have the ingredients for me?',70338),
(422,'Before I know what we are dealing with here, $c, I need to study the spell known as Remedy of Arugal.  Bring it to me now or I shall be forced to find myself a worthy servant.',70862),
(423,'I will need 6 Glutton Shackles and 3 Darksoul Shackles before I can assess the situation and devise a final solution for Arugal.  Now heed your bidding and slay Moonrage Gluttons and Moonrage Darksouls until you have what I need.',70862),
(424,'Has Grimson the Pale been slain?  Varimathras will not be pleased if we ignore his bidding.',70862),
(425,'Have you killed Ivar the Foul?  If you won\'t do it for me and my brother, then do it for the Forsaken.',70862),
(426,'Our battles with the Scourge wage on, $N.  Do your part and throw those cursed, mindless $r back into the Plaguelands!',70862);
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(429,'My time is short, $c, for the Dark Lady has charged me with a grave task.',70862),
(430,'My sister told me you were here to aid us.  Is that true?',70862),
(437,'Have you defeated Nightlash, $N?  Our success against the rot hides depends on her destruction!',70862),
(439,'$N.  You return, so I assume your investigations bore fruit?',70862),
(440,'Hello, $N.  What brings you back to Brill?',70862),
(441,'Do I know you?',70862),
(443,'Do you have the rot hide ichor, $N?',70862),
(444,'My studies require great concentration.  So I hope your visit is not a frivolous one.',70862),
(445,'What business do you have with me, $c?',70790),
(446,'Greetings, $N.  What did Bethor have to say?',70862),
(447,'Hail, $c.  What business do you have with the Royal Apothecary Society?',70862),
(449,'Did you discover the fate of the Deathstalkers?',70790),
(450,'I see you are back, $N.',70862),
(451,'What brings you back to the Undercity, $N?',70862),
(457,'Your task is not yet complete, $N.  Return to me once 8 mangy nightsabers and 8 thistle boars have been killed.',70790),
(459,'Satisfy my suspicions, $N.  Bring to me 8 Fel Moss.',70790),
(460,'This grave was hastily dug.',70338),
(461,'This is the spot!  Bring me closer...',70338),
(478,'Have you learned anything useful, $N?',70862),
(479,'We must hurry, their plans must not come to fruition, or we may lose our hold on Silverpine Forest.',70862),
(480,'Quickly, time runs short, $N!',70338),
(481,'Yes, $c? What is it?',70862),
(483,'$N, the kidnapped Druids of the Talon will be forever trapped in the Emerald Dream if we cannot retrieve the Relics of Wakening from the Ban\'ethil Barrow Den to the west.$B$BFor every minute we delay their fate comes one step closer to eternal doom.',70790),
(488,'Have you been a busy little bee, $N?  I\'ve been waiting for you to bring me what I need.',70790),
(489,'What do you have for me, $N?  A lovely snack I presume?',70790),
(491,'$N.  Have you defeated Thule Ravenclaw?',70338),
(492,'Why if I had my trusted rifle you\'d be as good as dead, $C.  Just wait until the Steam Tank Brigade arrives to rescue me!',70790),
(493,'You have something for me?',70862),
(496,'I see you are back.  I hope you were able to gather the agents I need.  Another deathless day will put me in such a gloomy mood.',70790),
(499,'Ribbit!',70790),
(501,'I remember you, $N.  You were going to help me out in concocting my latest elixir.  I\'ll need that blood before I can bring my own special brand of misery to the inhabitants of Hillsbrad.',70790),
(502,'Woof?',70840),
(509,'Any luck at Nethander Stead?',70862),
(529,'Were you able to carry out your orders, $c?  Did you dispose of Verringtan and his assistants?  And where is that iron shipment?',70840),
(530,'Do you have those hands, $N?',70790),
(532,'What news have you?',70862),
(533,'Have you found anything? I fear Gol\'dir\'s prospects grow worse by the day...',70862),
(544,'Did you find the thieves? And more importantly, did you find what they stole?',70862),
(546,'So the lucky $N returns?  How many humans have you slaughtered today?  Hundreds I do hope!$B$BHave you any skulls for me?',70862),
(552,'Have you recovered Helcular\'s Rod yet?  There are so many Yeti in this region, it will be very difficult to locate.  But we must have it in order to proceed.',70862),
(553,'Helcular\'s grave teems with a mystical energy.',70862),
(556,'Do you have the Worn Stone Tokens, $N?  The Magus is eager to unlock their secrets.',70862),
(557,'Hello, $N.  Elementals are tough quarry, but I know you\'re up to the task.  Do you have those bracers of binding?',70862),
(579,'King Anduin has placed great importance on learning, and thus has provided funds for making copies of various tomes and writings available to the public. It\'s very simple. You bring me a library scrip, and I can give you a copy of one of the available books.',70245),
(671,'Once-cursed blood still runs through my veins, $N. If someone... something is summoning demons, it must be stopped.',70862),
(672,'I will create an amulet that will give Gor\'mul some of the strength of the raptors. Perhaps that will awaken some flame within him...',70862),
(674,'What hope is there when the hand of a coward can slay the mightiest of the mightiest? What hope, I ask you!',70862),
(744,'This headdress will certainly be a wonderful gift for my brother.',70338),
(747,'Providing meat and feathers for the tribe is the first step in proving yourself as a hunter before the Chief.',70862),
(768,'Hello again.  Have you been hunting?  Do you have skins for me?',70862),
(769,'Do you have my supplies, $N?',70790),
(789,'The carapace of a scorpid isn\'t so thick that the strength of a determined warrior will be deterred. Strike strongly and without doubt, and the scorpids should prove easy prey.',70840),
(790,'Ahhh... my father always said I would never amount to much, and here, lying beneath a tree as life seeps away, I\'m afraid it looks like he was right.$B$BAt least I wish to die knowing that my last enemy in life lays dead.',70790),
(791,'I fought proudly alongside the Warchief when these lands were pioneered. The scars of battle mark my skin.$B$BThe honor of the Horde has been upheld with the help of my axe and battlecry during the defeat of Archimonde, when the unholy alliance was made with the humans and elves, wrought from necessity.$B$BBut my position as watchman and provider has given me a new sense of worth.',70862),
(794,'Is your task complete, $N?  Do you have the Burning Blade Medallion?',70840),
(806,'Did you find Fizzle, $N?  He, and rest of the Burning Blade, must be scoured from our lands!',70862),
(808,'Do you have my brother\'s skull, $N?  Is he finally free?',70840),
(812,'I\'m almost glad I can\'t return to Sen\'jin as I am now. My weakness and stupidity would surely be mocked.',70790),
(813,'Remember, no matter what creature you hunt, you would do well to study it and understand its behavior. That knowledge could save your life.',70790),
(815,'Breakfast, lunch, dinner! Who cares which meal it is? It still has to be cooked by someone--namely me!',70840),
(816,'I pray that Kron will return to me, but I\'m almost certain I know his fate already.',70862),
(817,'I remember my first tiger hunt, $N. I chose to hunt on the largest of the Echo Isles, and I sat perfectly still in the shadows of its foliage for almost a full day... watching... waiting.$B$BMy muscles were taut, and I was ready to strike. It was one of my greatest victories when that tiger finally took the bait.',70840),
(818,'Time is the true test of your strength and will. Lose patience or give in to weakness, and your true self will be shown.',70840),
(819,'Yes?',70862),
(821,'How\'s the search going?',70862),
(822,'You working hard at finding those ingredients, $N?',70862),
(824,'Ah, hello there.  I spend a great deal of time studying the water - all the elements really - so much so that sometimes I don\'t even notice people around me.$B$BIs there something I can help you with?',70862),
(825,'Once we learn how the humans operate their strange machinery, we will stand a greater chance of defeating them in future battles.$B$BWith our new gained knowledge, the Horde only stands to grow in strength.',70862),
(826,'Is Zalazane defeated, $N?',70840),
(827,'Have you yet entered Skull Rock, $N?  Do you have the Searing Collars?',70862),
(829,'My most humble greetings, $c.  How might I help my $r sister today?',70862),
(830,'There is a look of concern on your face, $c. What have you there?',70840),
(831,'Can you not see that I am busy? This had better be pressing....',70862),
(832,'You have something vital to report.  I can sense it behind your eyes.',70790),
(834,'I\'m great at what I do, don\'t get me wrong, but this is ridiculous! What am I supposed to do, build sand castles?',70862),
(840,'What do you want, pup? If you\'re not here for recruitment, I don\'t have time for you.',70862),
(842,'Well well well, what do we have here? Has Kargal deemed me worthy of another recruit?',70862),
(843,'Many innocent tauren lost their lives or were forced off their ancestral birthplace when the dwarves of Bael Modan arrived. My land must be reclaimed!',70862),
(844,'Have you collected the plainstrider beaks?',70862),
(845,'How many zhevra have you slain?',70862),
(846,'I see you are back, $N.$B$BWhile Khazgorm\'s death might delay the digging in my ancestral lands some, it will by no means bring a total end to the destruction.$B$BThe Keep at Bael Modan is an increasing military threat. Built to defend the dig site, it is now poised for offensive force as well.$B$BIf you have the ingredients I requested, I can fashion a charge that will make the hasty dwarves reconsider their actions here in the Barrens.',70862),
(848,'Do you have the spores, $N?  There is a concoction I must send to my associate in Thunder Bluff, which requires the spores...',70862),
(850,'Hello, $N.  Do you have Barak\'s Head for me?',70862),
(851,'Did you find Verog, $N?',70862),
(852,'Is Hezrul defeated, $N?',70862),
(853,'You have something from Apothecary Helbrim?',70862),
(855,'How goes your hunting, $N?',70862),
(857,'Where is the Tear of the Moons? I need it now! Need I say!',70862),
(858,'Quick, we need to get out of here before someone gets suspicious!',70862),
(862,'Whack enough dig rats yet, $N?',70862),
(865,'Did you get the horns, $N?  Those things are going to make me a fortune!',70862),
(866,'Hello, $N.  Did you get those root samples?',70862),
(867,'Cut up enough of them yet? Keep slicing and taking trophies. I want 8 Witchwing talons.',70862),
(868,'Be careful with the eggs you find, $N. If they break, they be no good to me.',70862),
(869,'Do you have those heads, $N?',70862),
(872,'Cut off the head of their leader, and chaos ensues, $N. Learn this lesson well. It will aid you in the future.$B$BThe boars will flounder without direction, and we will be able to take back the Barrens.',70862),
(873,'Fear not the waters, $r.',70790),
(875,'Do you have 6 Harpy Lieutenant Rings yet? Justice must be dealt to them for their vicious attacks on the Horde.',70862),
(876,'You\'re not getting anything until I see Serena\'s head.',70338),
(879,'How goes your hunt, $r? <snort>$B$BThork thinks he knows the truth about who leads the raids against his people, <snort> but he shall learn how wrong he is if you are successful.$B$BMy death is inescapable, but you have caused great pain to my enemies, so Mangletooth regrets nothing. <snort>',70862);
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(880,'How goes your collection?  Did you get the shells?',70862),
(881,'The great cat calls to you, $N.',70862),
(882,'$N, have you bested Ishamuhale?',70790),
(883,'$N, when you approached I saw a new power in your stride.  Tell me -- has your spirit met with the great Lakota\'mani?',70862),
(884,'$N, there is a new power behind your eyes!  You have met with the mighty Owatanka, have you not?',70862),
(885,'There is new resolve within you, $N.  A resolve born from pain...$B$BAre you burdened with the death of Washte Pawne?',70862),
(888,'Did you find my things, $N?',70862),
(889,'Bring Mangletooth 10 blood shards and I will bless you with great speed. You will run with zhevra and the wind will be jealous of you.$B$BIt will not last long, but it should be enough to help you travel throughout the Barrens.',70862),
(890,'Wares to send on the next ship, $N?',70862),
(891,'My fleet is in peril with Captain Fairmount and her damned cannoneers blasting away from Northwatch Hold. I want her soldiers to pay as well. Fill my hand with medals from their dead and I will know that vengeance has been given to my fallen privateers.',70862),
(892,'So, what did Dizzywig have to say?',70862),
(893,'I, too, have doubts that the pathetic quilboars could attain any level of skill in the area of smithing, but I do as the Warchief commands, and I shall learn what I can about the Razormane tribe.$B$BI have had more menial tasks, and I do so willingly if it aids the orc people.',70862),
(895,'What\'s happening? Something I can help you with? Goods to ship, perhaps an engineering job?',70862),
(896,'If only we knew which one of the miners had found the emerald, it\'d be a walk in the park...',70862),
(899,'The quilboar will pay for this, $N. I swear it.',70862),
(901,'The console lights are dimmed and the gauges and dials all read at their zero positions, everything idling.',70862),
(902,'Oh, you\'re back, $N! Do you have the samophlange?',70862),
(903,'How goes your hunt, $N?  Have you found the prowlers?',70862),
(906,'Yes, what is it?',70862),
(907,'Are the thunder lizards defeated, $N?',70790),
(913,'Is it done? Have you slain the thunderhawk?',70790),
(914,'Memories of my nightmares haunt me, $N.  Have you defeated the leaders of the fang and acquired their gems?',70790),
(916,'Did you gather the venom sacs, $N?',70790),
(917,'Have you been inside the Shadowthread Cave, $N?  Did you find a spider egg?',70790),
(918,'Do you have the seeds?  I am eager to plant them.',70790),
(919,'Hello, $N.  Have you found any sprouts near the waters?',70790),
(921,'The moonwells hold the waters of the Well of Eternity, the ancient source of magic that has wrought so many horrors upon our world.$B$BThe druids take advantage of its properties, and the Sentinels revere the wells as shrines to Elune, but sorcery is forbidden to all.',70790),
(922,'Hello...$B$BAnd how may I help you?',70790),
(928,'Greetings, $c. For what purpose do I owe the pleasure of our meeting?',70790),
(929,'Hello again, $N. Have you completed your task?',70790),
(933,'At first the reports of crazed furbolg attacks were dismissed. Who could have thought that the peace-loving bear-men would turn to mindless rage? Yet another of the problems that plagues us here in our new home.',70790),
(935,'I know that I did not summon you, so I cannot help but wonder why it is you have come to speak with me.$B$BWhatever it is, please make it quick.',70790),
(937,'Their slashing talons and piercing beaks may prove a difficult match for your own abilities, $N, but I have faith that you will not fail in this task.',70790),
(955,'Once I have the earrings, I will cast the spell to search for the whereabouts of the seal that binds me. For centuries I have thought on the freedom destroying the seal would bring to me... Perhaps those centuries have taken a toll upon my mind that I might never recover...',70790),
(959,'The dockmaster has been on my case ever since Mad Magglish made off with that 99-year-old port. I guess that bottle was intended as a gift for Gazlowe from none other than Baron Revilgaz himself.$B$BIf you\'re brave enough and patient enough to seek out Mad Magglish and get that port back, I\'ll see to it you get a nice reward.',70862),
(962,'I am eager to see if you can gather enough Serpentbloom from the Wailing Caverns. I\'ve sent many to do my bidding but none have returned.',70790),
(983,'Buzzbox 827 sits with an eerie silence. A single flashing light indicates that it needs 6 Crawler Legs to be placed in its holding box.',70790),
(997,'You have something for me?',70790),
(1013,'Did you find the book, $N?',70862),
(1014,'With Arugal\'s death we stand to increase the Dark Lady\'s stronghold on Lordaeron.',70862),
(1058,'Look at our poor little elf friends. All caged up with no forest to frolic in!$B$BNow were you able to find me some sap? How about the whiskers from the twilight runners? Don\'t suppose you have that fey dragon scale on you?$B$BAnd eyes! I\'ll need so many eyes! You just can\'t mix up a fierce forest magic brew without a good helping of eyes!',70338),
(1060,'You seem a shady character. You have something for me to see?',70334),
(1062,'The Greatwood Vale lies to the northwest, $N.  Go.  Strike fear into those who would pillage this land!',70862),
(1068,'The tree spirits wail at the loss of their brethren, $N.  You must destroy the shredders XT:4 and XT:9, or I fear Stonetalon will never be healed.',70338),
(1069,'Did you get the eggs, $N?  I already made a shipping deal with Wharfmaster Dizzywig!',70862),
(1088,'When my master bade me to the peak of Stonetalon, I expected that all I would need was to lay waste to the night elves that crawled the sacred ruins of our ancient temple of Azshara, their touch despoiling its sanctity... but Ordanus had slipped my grasp.',70338),
(1092,'Something I can help you with?',70291),
(1093,'Did you find those plans? I\'m eager to impress the new boss. Hopefully, once he\'s convinced of my loyalty--well, as much as he can be convinced... goblin\'s honor, you know?--he\'ll feel comfortable making use of my rather impressive genius.',70862),
(1094,'Hello there! How can I help you?',70338),
(1102,'Once I know the foul beasts of Razorfen Kraul have been driven from their foul lair, I will be able to rest in peace, knowing that revenge has been served.$B$BHave you the driven the quilboar from the Kraul? Do you bring to me good news in the form of Razorflank\'s heart?',70862),
(1109,'Ah, I see you have returned. Were you able to procure any Kraul Guano?',70862),
(1131,'Have you defeated the foul Steelsnap, $N?',70862),
(1145,'I envy you, $c. You have the look of someone who\'s been outside the walls of Orgrimmar for a while.$B$BI myself would travel in the name of the Warchief if Thrall didn\'t have need of my skills here in the city. But he leads us well, and I trust his judgement--I remain here for as long as he needs me.',70862),
(1150,'You must be prepared spiritually, physically and mentally for the challenges that lie ahead of you.$B$BToo often do we rush forward before we are ready. I consider it my duty to the youth, no matter which tribe they belong to, to prepare them for the dangers they may face after they leave the sanctity of their home.',70862),
(1151,'Rok\'Alim is also called the Pounder by the centaur tribes in Thousand Needles because of the thundering his fists make as he pummels the creatures brave, or stupid, enough to stand in his path.',70862),
(1153,'I saw the travelers again--the ones that would not sell me a sample of the ore. I spit at them for not helping the warchief.$B$BMay they die in battle like cowards and not like warriors as should be the right of all people who ally themselves with the Horde.',70862),
(1195,'Once we have the filled phial, we can send it along to my associate, Rau, in the Thousand Needles. He was the one who requested the phial of water, so he\'ll better know how we can make use of it.',70862),
(1196,'I don\'t suppose you\'ve been sent by Zangen, hm?',70862),
(1197,'I am eager to put my hands upon the Cloven Hoof. Have you taken it yet?',70862),
(1221,'Do you have the tubers, $N?',70862),
(1358,'You have a package for me?',70790),
(1359,'You have something for me?',70790),
(1470,'Your power is little now, though I suspect already you sense the possibilities.$B$BEven the dead might feel alive, with that power coursing through us.',70235),
(1471,'I expect to hear of your success, $N. Not meeting my expectations will be the least of your worries, however, should you fail.',70245),
(1473,'Egalin was the teacher that taught me. With hardly a look, he was able to command the voidwalker he had summoned.$B$BWhen it came my turn to try, I was overconfident. Do not trifle with the powers that you wield, $N, they can consume even the vigilant.',70235),
(1485,'It is important that you can control the beings that you summon through your magic. There are few enough interested in learning the ways of the $c that I would risk throwing your life away by teaching you something before you are ready.',70790),
(1486,'I am very interested in examining the hides from the deviate creatures who have infested these caves. Have you had any luck in collecting some, $c?',70790),
(1487,'$N, we, the Disciples of Naralex, need your help. Our numbers are dwindling with our master trapped in his twisted nightmare. We have not the forces necessary to deal with the corrupt creatures which now haunt these caverns.$B$BI beg of you, enter the caves and wage war on the deviate creatures!',70790),
(1491,'Where is my wailing essence?',70790),
(1492,'You seek passage on the next ship, or have some item you wish to send aboard it?',70862),
(1498,'Do you have the scales, $N?  Unless you can withstand the attacks of the thunder lizards, you will not benefit from my instruction.',70338),
(1501,'Do you have the Tablet of Verga, $N? If not, I do not wish to speak with you until you do.',70862),
(1504,'The voidwalker is a powerful creature. I remember when it was I that was in your shoes, $N. Over the years, my own voidwalker has grown to fight me less, though I suspect that is only because it hopes I will let my guard down.$B$BRemember that, $N.',70862),
(1516,'Patience is earth\'s greatest virtue. The earth witnesses the cycle of all things: the mountains becoming deserts; rivers becoming canyons. The earth is the most stubborn and wise of all the elements and it does not tolerate impatience.$B$BThe earth beckons you now because a time of conflict draws near. When you return to me successful, then you shall be that much closer to being made whole.$B$BOthers will be envious of your wisdom and hate you for their ignorance.',70790),
(1518,'I wish to be the first to welcome you fully to the first of four paths that will forever lead you in your destiny.$B$BIf you have the stone the earth gave to you, I will give you the totem it promised.$B$BIf not, then be gone with you until you have found your way.',70790),
(1524,'Greetin\'s, $N. You\'ve found yourself at the Shrine of the Dormant Flame. Only those knowledgeable enough in the shamanistic arts will ever learn the secrets of this place and the power it holds. I\'m sorry you made the trip all this way, only to be turned back now--the journey up here is far from safe after all--but I am the keeper of the shrine, and I cannot allow just anyone to wander around here.',70790),
(1525,'I have enough ingredients for a sapta of fire if you can find the reagent pouch and some fire tar. The Burning Blade fanatics carry the proper components for most of their spells in those pouches, and usually have enough of the items I need that we will not have to search much farther for anything else.$B$BThe saptas are always made from ingredients that are closely tied to their respective elements. It makes our work easier because of the warlocks\' ties to fire.',70790),
(1526,'The brazier stands about a third your height, and looks normal, save for the inscriptions along its smooth metal rails. The metal shows no signs of wear from the weather, and the bowl seated at the top of it feels cool to the touch.',70790),
(1527,'Yes, $N? What do you have there?',70790),
(1534,'Do you have the water yet, $N? Tales say the ruins were protected by large creatures of nature that do not care for visitors, but those could be myths to scare off the enemies of the night elves.$B$BRegardless, be careful.',70862),
(1535,'I am just about prepared to send you on your other tasks. Have you filled the skin yet?$B$BI know how protective the quilboar can be. Even such a small water source is a vast hoard of wealth to them. They have great feasts when even the slightest rain comes to the Barrens. Water is sacred to their kind because it is so scarce. Do you understand?',70862),
(1536,'The well remaining pure within the town reminds me of stories told to me when I was younger, $N. Even in times of great pain and sorrow one can find a sliver of hope, a small symbol to rally around. The orc people see Thrall this way. He survived against great odds and rose up to lead our people through his strength and example.$B$BI\'m not sure any orc has suffered as much as he has, but at the same time, I\'m not sure any orc is as strong as he is either.',70862),
(1882,'Do you have the snapdragons?  That breed of flower is highly receptive to magic energies, and studying the snapdragons so close to the Plaguelands can tell us if the plague has entered Tirisfal Glades.',70790),
(1918,'Yeah, what do you need?',70862),
(1944,'I am pleased you have returned with your skin intact, $N.  Do you have the water sample?  I am eager to study its properties.',70862),
(1960,'Have you investigated the disturbance, $N?  Have you captured the creatures?',70790),
(1961,'Anastasia said you would come to me, and I am prepared to fashion your robes.  Do you have the gems and the linen?',70790),
(2038,'$N! Where are my things?!',70862),
(2159,'How might I be of service to you, young one?  Are you here to rest in the inn?  Do you require a hearthstone?',70790),
(2161,'Welcome to Razor Hill!',70840),
(2841,'I don\'t see any blueprints. Did you hide them somewhere on your body or are you just standing around here to irritate me?$B',70862),
(2945,'The gnomish contraption before you bears a plaque calling it "The Sparklematic 5200".  The gist of the machine, from reading the instructions below the plaque, is to scrub away dirt that an item might have.  The machine has a coin slot, accepting three silver coins to start the process once the item is placed inside it.$B$BIt would seem as though the grime-encrusted ring you found earlier is just the thing to try in this machine!',70862),
(2949,'You\'d think that we would find a way on our own to outdo those filthy little gnomes.  I would even wager that they stole that rig from us to begin with!  Bah, those greasy, grimy... erm, yes?  You need something?',70862),
(2950,'Do you have the materials I need?  I can\'t improve on this design without everything I asked for.',70862),
(3082,'Jen\'shan see a mighty $c before her and da spirits approve.$B$BDa path of da $c is one of our oldest walks of life. Da Horde turned to us when they be just strugglin\' to survive on Azeroth, and they ask us to teach them, to show them the secrets of many tings. They were strong already: strong in shaman ways; strong in warrior ways. But the $c path not be their path... then.',70840),
(3084,'Ah, welcome, $N. I\'m pleased you have arrived. My days have become long and even busy what with so many students to teach, but the coming of one of your ilk brings me a great sense of accomplishment--I remember the days when I was taught by one of your shamans.',70790),
(3088,'Shhh, not so loud. I don\'t trust Nartok over there. Anyone that has to hide deeper in a cave than I do shouldn\'t be trifled with.$B$BI trust you had no problem finding your way around?',70338),
(3097,'Ah, so between fire, plague, rioting, and much worse, one more of the "faithful" comes to my door. Well, let me bid you welcome, $c. And allow me a moment to explain a thing or two before you decide it\'s time for you to seek whatever drives you forward: the Holy Light no longer concerns you, the spirits of your forefathers are fairy tales, and creatures from the Nether don\'t want you.$B$BDo you understand me so far?',70862),
(3098,'I knew you would come to me, $N. Not because you do not have the will to follow your own path, but because we are kindred spirits. We both have felt pain. We have both suffered. And now we want the power to take back what we know is ours: this land, our lives, our destinies. But there is much for you to learn still.',70790),
(3099,'I bid you welcome, sister. I knew you would come. It was only a matter of time.$B$BWhat I said interested you, didn\'t it? I hit a chord... something inside you knew what I claimed was truth. Good.$B$BKnow this though: I am no traitor to Sylvanas. If anything, she would appreciate my claims considering it was her own beliefs that has put the Forsaken in the position it is now.',70235);
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(3103,'Ah, at last you\'ve come. I knew you would find your way to me. The Holy Light shines upon you, and the path you\'ve chosen. These times are harsh--the Burning Legion still has a presence upon Azeroth, the entirety of Kalimdor seeks new ways to defend itself from its own tribulations, and it is up to you to aid as many as you can.',70790),
(3104,'Hello, $N. I am Khelden. Is there something I can do for you?',70790),
(3117,'You\'ve arrived, and none too soon, $N. Welcome to Shadowglen.$B$BI trust my sigil found you in good spirits and health?$B$BAs I said previously, I am here to train you as a $c; to tame beasts to aid you in battle; to use a bow with unerring accuracy; to respect the lands which we call home and also the lands beyond.',70790),
(3281,'Do you have the silver?',70862),
(3301,'I can smell the dust of the Barrens on you, $c.  You have traveled far.',70862),
(3369,'May I help you with something?',70790),
(3513,'Whaddya got?',70862),
(3521,'Please, collect the ingredients, $N. Iverron needs our help.',70790),
(3522,'Oh... $N, I\'m so glad you have returned.',70790),
(3524,'It is only recently that these creatures started landing on the coast of Darkshore in such alarming numbers.  I can\'t help but think that this is an ill omen of some sort.  Recovering a sample of that creature\'s bones to the south would help us in Darnassus assess this situation!',70790),
(3861,'The chicken stares at you with dark, cold eyes. It waits for you hungrily.$B$B"BACAAAW!$B$BCluck...cluck...cluck."',70840),
(3902,'Have you managed to scavenge up some useful items for us?  There is no shame in reusing that which has been tossed aside.  No one is going to give us any handouts - we Forsaken will fend for ourselves!',70862),
(3904,'Do you have my harvest, $N?  ',70790),
(3905,'You look to be in fine spirits!  Come!  Have a seat, and have a drink!',70790),
(3921,'I\'m very busy with my work, $c.  Unless you have something for me, it\'d be best if you moved along...',70862),
(3922,'Do you have the nugget slugs, $N?  I\'ve been eyeing this Samophlange and I can\'t wait to tinker with it.',70862),
(3923,'Mind your head!  I don\'t want it to get in the way of my work!',70862),
(3924,'Do you have the manual?',70338),
(4021,'Do you have the banner?',70840),
(4161,'Remember the balance, $N. I wish you to develop an understanding and a strong empathy for the living forests.',70790),
(4402,'Have you finished collecting cactus apples?',70840),
(4542,'What do you want, $c? An urgent message - for me?$B',70862),
(4581,'Do you have something for me?',70450),
(4603,'The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!',70862),
(4767,'$N, have you retrieved the wyvern eggs that I seek? I\'m really anxious to start my wind rider training!',70862),
(4821,'I must know more about this mysterious egg, who knows what will hatch from it.',70862),
(4841,'Come now $N, I know you haven\'t killed your share yet. Hunt them down, and I shall give you a reward for my gratitude.$B',70862),
(5041,'How goes your search for the supplies, $N? I trust the quilboar fall under your strength easily.',70862),
(5042,'I will need 4 blood shards if you wish Agamaggan\'s strength, skyborne.$B$BYour foes will cower before your strength were you to be given this blessing. <snort>$B$BThe Razormane\'s greatest warriors are infused with such power!',70840),
(5043,'My tribes greatest scouts are said to be unrivaled in their accuracy, and no rogue <snort> could measure up to their quickness in battle.$B$BBring me 4 blood shards and I will make you even more agile than any quilboar born.',70291),
(5044,'The shaman and geomancers of the quilboar tribes <snort> call upon the strength of Agamaggan to help them in battle and in their rituals, $r.$B$BIf you too wish the added power of Agamaggan\'s blessing with your spells, then bring me 4 blood shards and Mangletooth will aid you. <snort>',70790),
(5045,'Warriors of all types <snort> have need of a strong spirit. It drives you to greater feats when all hope has been lost. This is not unknown to the <snort> Razormane. We are a spiritual tribe--we are more proud of our connection to Agamaggan than our prowess <snort> in battle.$B$BBring me 4 blood shards and I will bless your spirit for battle. <snort>',70862),
(5046,'All those who <snort> enter battle have need of protection. Their bones must be strong. Their skin tough. <snort> My tribe knows this as well, and to add to the natural protection our quills and hide give us, <snort> we often call upon Agamaggan to protect us from harm before we go to war.$B$BBring me 4 blood shards <snort> and I will grant you the same protection.',70862),
(5052,'Our tribes flock to the thorny areas throughout the Barrens <snort> because they are holy places, but none as holy as Razorfen. Agamaggan\'s body makes up the entirety of the Razorfen, <snort> but the Downs are especially protected because the entrance is made from his great maw! <snort> It will swallow whole those not loyal to him, and spit out their bodies after he\'s chewed them up! <snort>$B$BAgamaggan has left his body behind to protect us, and he gives of his spirit so we may protect him. <snort>',70862),
(5062,'So, Motega Firemain sends word of Arikara...well now that is grave news.$B$B<Magatha looks around.>$B$BArikara is a deadly creature born only to seek vengeance against those who have committed heinous acts.$B$B<Magatha smiles.>',70862),
(5064,'Have you discovered what the Grimtotem are up to?',70862),
(5088,'Have you slain the vicious serpent Arikara, $N?',70862),
(5147,'Have you any news of that murderous Arnak Grimtotem?',70862),
(5151,'Do you have my hypercapacitor?',70862),
(5421,'I\'ll reward anyone who makes my life a bit easier... I enjoy doing as little as possible, mon!$B$BBelow the docks here in Shadowprey Village, I\'ve many shellfish traps.  If you\'re kind enough to do my work and collect me my shellfish, then I\'ll reward you with something you want... get my drift mon?  For every five shellfish you bring me I will give you a fine Bloodbelly fish!',70338),
(5441,'No good lazy...$B$B Eh?  Do you have my blackjack?  Did you catch any peons sleeping on the job?!',70840),
(5481,'Where\'s that useless abomination? Either you have what I need or you\'d best get out there and find it.',70862),
(5482,'This had better be good. I trust you have all of the doom weed that I require?',70862),
(5545,'That deadline isn\'t getting any further away, $c. Please hurry and collect those bundles of wood.',70790),
(5723,'How goes your search for the Chasm? And the troggs?$B$BThe threat cannot be allowed to persist--it will only injure our $r brethren if it continues.',70338),
(5724,'Were you able to find anything, $N? Any clues as to why one of her clansman had to die needlessly would be helpful.',70862),
(5725,'There are a hundred other tasks awaiting my attention, $c. Do you have the books?',70862),
(5726,'Do you have the insignia yet, $N?$B$BIt will be a vital tool in infiltrating what I believe is the greatest threat to the Horde, and finally finding peace in our new home.$B$BYou will learn how intricate a web men and orcs alike can weave when they are motivated by greed and power. The hidden agendas, the corruption, all of it will become clear. You will find yourself in the midst of a war you never knew existed.',70862),
(5761,'Have you killed the beast? He surely must be the leader of the Searing Blade in Ragefire Chasm.',70862),
(5881,'You have news from Maggran Earthbinder?',70862),
(6127,'You are the one that the Cenarion Circle in Moonglade sent, yes?  This is most fortuitous for us!  We are stymied in our effort to bring balance to the sickly gazelles that wander the northern Barrens; we\'re happy for all the help we can get.$B$BDo you have the sample of water that Dendrite Starblaze said you\'d have?  He notified me that you\'d draw one so we could work on a cure together...',70790),
(6128,'Have you got the reagents I need to make the salve?  The gazelle aren\'t getting any better on their own, so we better not tarry in our effort to save them!',70790),
(6181,'You look like you\'re in a hurry.  Well, then you came to the right place!',70862),
(6261,'Is that sweat on your brow, lad?  You\'ve been running too much.  Next time, take a gryphon!',70862),
(6281,'You\'ve been traveling, eh?  Have you been anywhere interesting?',70862),
(6283,'Bloodfury Ripper is a nasty creature! You will have success finding her along the western hill line in the Charred Vale.$B$BThe bloodfuries will be helpless with out... surely we can vanquish them forever!',70862),
(6284,'Besseleth is a ruthless predator... I fear for those that travel Webwinder Path at night. It\'s then that she and her children prey upon innocent travelers. I myself fell prey to her two-foot fang of death, but luckily I was able to fend her off and get to safety. I would give anything to see that monster destroyed.',70862),
(6285,'You\'re back from Stormwind?  Did Osric send the armor?',70862),
(6301,'The continuous destruction caused by war and those that seek a profit from lumber pains me deeply. To aid the cycle of rebirth and replenish the lands, I need Gaea seeds. Do you have them, $c?',70862),
(6321,'You appear to be on official business...',70790),
(6322,'If you must travel a long distance, then a bat is your best option.',70790),
(6323,'I keep my weapons in top condition.  They are cleaned and ready for use.',70790),
(6324,'$N, you return.  Do you have our supplies from the Undercity?',70790),
(6365,'You need to get somewhere fast?  Then you\'re talking to the right orc!',70862),
(6381,'These seeds you plant are strong, resisting corruption, and making a foothold for other life. They will grow and grow, first preventing corruption and healing the scarred land, and then one day, restoring Stonetalon to a lush forest, once again.$B$BHave you planted all of the Gaea seeds?',70862),
(6384,'Something smells good!  You don\'t have raw meat on you, do you?',70862),
(6385,'Do you need one of my wind riders?',70862),
(6386,'Have you returned from Orgrimmar?  Did Gryshka like the meat I sent her?',70862),
(6387,'Have you had your fill of Thelsamar so soon?  Are you ready to leave for another city?',70338),
(6391,'What can I do for you, my lady?',70338),
(6393,'The Tribunal of the Tides grows impatient. They seek to end this war that has raged across all dimensions for eons. My brethren are anxious to hear news of the glorious victory over the hated fire elementals. Have you the Incendrites that I require?',70862),
(6394,'Have you entered the Burning Blade Coven, $N?  Did you find my pick?',70840),
(6395,'We must respect our dead, $N.  It is one of the ways in which we differ from the Scourge...',70790),
(6421,'What news have you discovered from Boulderslide Ravine? I recall some legend that deals with Resonite... I just cannot place my hoof on it. Perhaps knowing what lies at the bottom of the cave will illuminate their devious intentions.',70338),
(6441,'I hope you can be quick about getting those horns, $N. I\'m heading back to Ratchet soon!',70862),
(6442,'The naga increase in numbers, $N. Please complete this task for me.',70862),
(6462,'Did you find the charms, $N?  Every moment the furbolgs possess those sacred items, my blood boils with rage!',70862),
(6504,'I hope you find the pages soon, $N! I really need to get back to work!',70862),
(6522,'What business is it you wish to speak of, $N? You must feel it is important if you continue to pester me.',70862),
(6545,'So you\'re here with my orders? Always good to see a new recruit with an exuberant nature and a strong will.$B$BYou\'d best learn fast if you expect to keep up here. The threat of the naga grows, $N. I have observed and have taken up defenses against several attacks on this outpost since I arrived here.$B$BBut if you\'d like to pitch in with that effort, speak with one of the others here at the outpost.',70862),
(6546,'Much danger lies along this path, $N. You\'d do best to remember this while traveling in these lands. The threat of the alliance is quite near.$B$BWe are faced by enemies on all fronts. The satyr are a formidable and prevalent force in eastern Ashenvale.  I have also discovered that the naga have taken over a large area of the land of Azshara.$B$BIt\'s good to see that we are still bolstering our numbers -- be ready for what lies ahead, $N.',70862),
(6547,'Keep an eye out, skyborne. The elves are often hiding in the shadows...$B$BWe must always be watching. We have worked very hard to claim this land, and the elves are looking for a chance to take it from us.$B$BI assume you have my next orders from Kadrak?',70862),
(6561,'May the Earthmother be with you, $N.$B$BPeace between the earth and all her people should be our goal. She has a grand plan for nature, and we all have a role to play in that plan.',70862),
(6563,'How goes your search for the crystals, $N? Have you witnessed the naga harvesting them? I pray to my ancestors we find the reason they are collecting such things.',70862),
(6564,'Yes, $N? What is it you need? There is still much I must learn about the crystals the naga are gathering.',70862),
(6571,'I hope you can come through with the supplies! I\'m in big trouble if I don\'t deliver them soon!',70862),
(6581,'Direct from Ratchet, the Warsong saw blades! Yep, I have them right here.$B$B..But what sort of payment do you have for me? You can\'t just take them, you know! My time isn\'t cheap!$B$BWhat I really need is a good gun to carry with me on my travels. A girl\'s gotta protect herself, you know? There\'s a gun I really like that I\'m sure an engineer would have no problem making.$B$BSo, if you bring me a deadly blunderbuss, I\'ll give you the saw blade shipment. Do we have a deal?',70862),
(6621,'Did you defeat Chief Murgut, $N?  Did you retrieve his Foulweald Totem?',70862),
(6921,'Have you been successful in locating the fathom core?  Without it we\'ll have no idea what the Twilight\'s Hammer is exactly up to down there.',70862),
(6922,'Ah, hello again $N.  I was just reading the waves the sea, much like I always do.  What brings you to the outpost?',70862),
(6981,'Hello, $r. What can I do for you?',70790),
(7321,'Any luck finding the ingredients?  I\'ll tell you, the alliance maggots are far too numerous in this area now... In my opinion, they have come far too close already...',70862),
(7383,'Along with the druids, the Oracle Tree and the Arch Druid have been carefully monitoring the growth of Teldrassil. But though we have a new home, our immortal lives have not been restored.',70790),
(7791,'We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Stormwind for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',70245),
(7813,'We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by the Undercity for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',70245),
(8193,'Every Sunday, we have a contest to determine the greatest anglers of them all! Just be among the FIRST 50 PEOPLE to bring me some Tastyfish fished from the Tastyfish schools found along the coasts of Stranglethorn and you will be declared a Master Angler!$B$BIf you\'re too slow, my apprentice here will still reward you with money for some Tastyfish you bring her.$B$BOh, and don\'t delay, Tastyfish go bad quickly, so don\'t even think about holding onto them for next week!',70862),
(8221,'*Whir* *Click*$B$B  I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue.   If you bring me a Keefer\'s Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. $B$B *Zzzap* *Whir*',70862),
(78142,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70862),
(78143,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790),
(78145,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790);
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(78149,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70862),
(79094,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790),
(79095,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790),
(79096,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790),
(79097,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70790),
(79361,'There are many who practice shamanism in this world. It is up to us to ensure that the land is protected from misuse.',70338),
(79366,'Have you any news of the storm?',70338),
(79442,'Great battle with de elements, mm? Tings turned out how they was always meant to.$B$BBut since you here, what brings you to ol\' Bath\'rah?',70338),
(79947,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70862),
(79949,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70862),
(86576,'I have important matters to consider, $c. Be quick.',70862),
(86585,'That banner looks like it\'s been in a war!',70338),
(86667,'Eh? What do you want?',70338),
(86784,'Welcome to my fire, traveler.',70862),
(87288,'It is good to see you again! Are you here to trade?',70790),
(90902,'Mastery of the light will return, in time.',70334),
(91725,'Did you find the supplies?',70862),
(91732,'Have you been to the mine yet?',70790),
(91741,'What\'s that you got there? It looks like one of my books.',70790),
(91743,'Have you rescued my books yet, $N?!',70790),
(91751,'Any luck with those wolf pelts?',70790),
(91899,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',70338),
(91900,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',70862),
(91920,'Oh. You\'re back?',70862),
(91921,'You return! I was beginning to come to terms with devolving into a ghoul.',70862),
(92421,'What remains of the invading scourge? Have you managed to find suitable replacement parts?',70790),
(92434,'Stay your weapon, $r.$B$BI think you will find that key won\'t be enough to get past my wards. You didn\'t truly think we would leave such a vulnerability open at a time like this, did you?',70862),
(92462,'Such pests cannot be allowed to find root in our peaceful grove. An infestation can quickly grow dangerous if left unchecked.',70205),
(92463,'Cirrusflies aren\'t to be underestimated. They might not seem dangerous, but you have to watch out for the bigger ones. The bigger they are, the meaner!',70245),
(92470,'What I ask of you is not easy, but you must be prepared for much greater challenges if you are to survive long enough to be of service to Zephras Isle.',70790),
(92473,'The ursera have grown far more aggressive of late. I wonder what has changed to cause this shift in behavior?',70790),
(92482,'<Tai\'ree nods at you curtly.>',70245),
(92484,'Winds guide you, $N.',70338),
(92485,'Greetings, I am Xyton Silverwind, keeper of druidic lore.',70790),
(92515,'If you ask me, I think Prideclaws are actually kind of cute. From a safe distance... and while standing behind someone holding a sword, of course.',70790),
(92550,'It feels good to turn the tables on these zealots.',70790),
(92551,'There\'s a lot of hungry and desperate skyborne here who need these supplies.',70790),
(92553,'No matter how much things change here on Zephras and how uncertain things get, I always say that a pipe full of dried peacebloom and nice full belly is a comfort that can\'t be beat!',70790),
(92579,'A letter from Aonda. What\'s that crafty highlander been up to?',70790),
(92644,'You are back? And... alone?',70790),
(92679,'What? Alvarion is alive?',70790),
(92682,'These bandits are more likely to double cross and steal from each other than they are to steal from normal folks. I bet if Ferauu knew some of his people went rogue and came here early to tamper with the harvest, he\'d kill them himself.',70790),
(92683,'Flutterflies are normally docile and calm, but rub them the wrong way and sometimes they\'ll surprise you.',70790),
(92684,'I don\'t think I\'ve had real meat for dinner in... well, too long.',70790),
(92685,'If you manage to bring me enough bandit masks, maybe I\'ll stitch a blanket out of them and give it to Ferauu.$B$B<Aamelia laughs loudly.>',70790),
(92693,'There\'s not enough stormapples in skywall to repay you for this.',70790),
(92701,'A letter from Aonda. What\'s that crafty highlander been up to?',70245),
(92706,'What can I do for ya, $r?',70790),
(92741,'The High Order do not make it a habit to employ themselves as simple trappers and game wardens, but when performing a service such as this can lead to scholarly gain, we are happy to engage in acts of community service.',70245),
(92742,'Did you collect the samples?',70862),
(92744,'I hope the murlocs did not give you too much trouble?',70862),
(92747,'Did you find anything?',70862),
(92749,'Show me those explosives, $N!',70862),
(92751,'Did you get a remote detonator? A normal one simply won\'t do!',70862),
(92752,'Were your efforts in Stormwind fruitful?',70862),
(92834,'I don\'t agree with the Windshapers often, but they were right to dismiss the idea of trying to engage peacefully with the Al\'Aketh. My attempt to take the high road cost a dear friend his life and is a mistake I will have to live with for the rest of my days.',70245),
(92840,'It\'s often difficult for me to establish a distinction between the Windshapers and the Al\'Aketh, save that one is more overtly violent than the other. Equally slavish to their misplaced beliefs, they are both equally dangerous if left to their own devices.$B$BThey see our desire to better understand this realm and its magic as a desecration of their traditions. Their small-mindedness is why our mission is so important. If not us, who will have the courage to save Zephras?',70245),
(92850,'Those shrieklings are too dangerous to be left to nest this close to Valanaar. However... they are the least of our troubles.',70245),
(92909,'It\'s a mess out there, $N! Did you collect the parts I need?',70862),
(93160,'Mmm, I think you are going to like what I can cook up with these acorns!',70790),
(93165,'I will not rest until my fangs have gone through the throat of every single cultist on this isle.',70790),
(93317,'Windsong Crawler meat is common enough here but it was something of a delicacy on the islands of Anvilas and Siroccas. Was a time, back when the skystreams were open that the locals would mob me for the stuff when I\'d make the trip to Shen\'dramar or New Eldre\'naar.$B$BNot been able to visit those places in... well... a long time.',70790),
(93318,'I\'ll need the creature\'s head as proof of the deed.',70790),
(93319,'These sneakthieves have likely been breaking into our supplies for months. I tried to convince Aonda to put a raid together to clear out that bandit cave for good, but she didn\'t want to pull the few peacekeepers we have away from the village. $B$BWith the cultists at Falaath Village to the south growing in numbers, I suppose I can\'t fault her for that.',70790),
(93459,'<Vayn nods at you.>',70245),
(93552,'Hello there, $c.',70790),
(93680,'What have you found? An ancient tome? A secret relic?',70862),
(93736,'Shadowgale Forest is a dangerous place. Some even say it\'s haunted. I\'m quite sure that I don\'t believe that, but I do know that it\'s not for the faint hearted, or the unprepared.',70790),
(93737,'I can\'t imagine why anyone would want to steal these components from this construct. Other than the gyrozephyr these components have almost no practical application. Even the gyro would be nigh-useless outside of its intended purpose.',70790),
(93740,'The Al\'Aketh have engaged in their bloody zealotry for far too long. This is only the start of the reckoning they face.',70790),
(93927,'What news from the western watch?',70790),
(93948,'What is that you have for me? Oh... oh no.',70790),
(93951,'What beautiful things did you bring me?',70790),
(94013,'You will learn, $N, and one day you will be a great $c.',70245),
(94485,'Have you found the Lady\'s Tear?',70790),
(94486,'It deeply saddens me to ask you to kill the young shrieklings, but with the rise in their aggression it is for the best. We can only handle so many emergencies at a time.',70790),
(94487,'I will make the cult pay for every drop of $c blood they have spilled this day.',70790),
(94488,'Are our brethren\'s lives truly worth so little to you, Haalien?',70790),
(94896,'So many of us left with nothing more than the clothes on our backs. Any belongings you might recover would be cherished.',70790),
(94897,'Have you any news of Resaan? Please, $c, the wait is hard to endure after everything that has happened.',70790),
(94978,'You will learn, $N, and one day you will be a great $c.',70245),
(94979,'You will learn, $N, and one day you will be a great $c.',70245),
(95065,'Did you get the fishing supplies?',70862),
(95204,'What have you got there, $c? A tasty morsel?',70790),
(95212,'You look chilly, $c. How goes the hunt?',70338),
(95216,'Any fool can tell you the most potent transmission method will always be through the blood.$B$BI must see this strain for myself!',70790),
(95314,'I trust you did not get lost?',70790),
(95328,'Do you have something for me, $c?',70790),
(95494,'How goes the hunt?',70862),
(95495,'Greetings, $c. What brings you up to my property today?',70862),
(95507,'<Vrang grunts at you as you approach.>',70862),
(95621,'The remnants of Daelin Proudmoore\'s fleet who still fly his banner are just as rotten and barbaric as the admiral himself was before he died.$B$BI don\'t know why they are so far from Tiragarde, but it can\'t be good.',70862),
(95664,'Spirits honor you. Have you come to share with us?',70862),
(95682,'We\'re here to get the important job done. If you can help, prove it.',70862),
(95697,'Farm-raised boar, farm-raised crawler... what\'s next, farm-raised raptor?',70862),
(95774,'I have only memories now, but I will build a tribute to Olgra so that they never fade.',70862),
(95883,'<The offering stone is ominously still.>',70790),
(95885,'<The offering stone is ominously still.>',70790),
(95998,'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors is critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.',70790),
(96241,'Did ya get what I need?',70862);
INSERT INTO `eglink_request_items` (`ID`,`Txt`,`Build`) VALUES
(96260,'This silk\'s remarkable properties could be used to make lightweight, durable cloth with remarkable defensive properties. I am eager to experiment with more of it.',70862),
(96294,'What is this?',70862),
(96391,'Oh what\'s this, then?',70862),
(96393,'What do ye need, citizen?',70862),
(96403,'<Thom appears to absentmindedly rub his hands together as he looks at you.>',70862),
(96626,'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.',70790),
(96634,'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.',70790),
(96652,'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?',70840),
(96822,'Have you done what I asked?',70840),
(96825,'Did you find the fruits?',70862),
(96873,'What do you have for me, $N?',70840),
(96876,'Something need doing?',70840),
(96877,'Yes?',70790),
(96898,'I\'d advise you not come into too much physical contact with those crystals. Even shattered and spent, the lingering magic in these necrotic crystals is highly dangerous.',70790),
(96987,'Well? Didja find their library? There\'s gotta be somethin\' good in there.',70338),
(97003,'It took the strength of six skilled fighters to defeat one of these creatures, and it still managed to fell four of us before we could put it down.$B$BIf these monstrous beasts were to appear in greater numbers, the damage that the quilboar could inflict upon the land could be catastrophic.',70790),
(97220,'You looking to fill a crate with our finest aged wheels?',70862),
(97223,'The Bloodtalon are known for their cunning and swiftness, and make fine companions when raised from egg to adult.$B$BUnfortunately adult raptors are very difficult to train, and I have tried to capture the Matriarch on more than one occasion. But she had become too dangerous of late.$B$BStill I hope to preserve her legacy by raising her children as companions here in Sen\'Jin.',70840),
(97225,'Have you found our loa idols, $N? We must begin our rituals again soon.',70840),
(97242,'We discover formulations and recipes by showing old ingredients to new generations, who experiment with them in their own way.',70862),
(97249,'I think we can win this one...',70790),
(97253,'Not another word out of you until your pockets are jingling with metal!',70862),
(97279,'Throm\'ka, $c. Gorak told me I should be expecting you. It is good to see you in one piece!$B$BWere you able to collect the training weapons I requested?',70840),
(97282,'It might come as a surprise that with a name like thunder lizard they shoot lightning instead of roaring like thunder.$B$BWell, they do. Shoot lightning, I mean.$B$BTrust me, it\'s a lesson you only get to learn once if you\'re lucky.',70862),
(97288,'What have we here?',70862),
(97289,'<The abomination remains lifeless without a head to control it.>',70790),
(97291,'It will be ever so lovely to have our lost sheep returned to the fold, don\'t you think?',70790),
(97292,'For Othmar\'s crimes against the Dark Lady, placing him under that oozing specimen is the least he deserves.$B$BAnd it\'s funny...',70790),
(97326,'It\'s nice to not have to always sit in the dirt!',70790),
(97485,'There are many occasions one may choose to spread incense to the winds. You could be asking the Earthmother to watch over someone, bless a hunt, celebrate an occasion, or even to seek guidance from our ancestors.$B$BOr it could be something else entirely.$B$BThough the act is done with reverence, it is not strictly a ceremonial affair. Typically there are certain traditional steps observed when performing this act, but many tribes have differing practices.',70790),
(97538,'You have returned! Were you able to find the mirkweed plant pods in Mirkfallon Lake?$B$BWe tauren have used this plant pigment in our paints for generations, so any amount you manage to bring would be appreciated. Though there are many ways to get a red pigment, I find the mirkweed to give the richest and most vibrant hue of the methods I\'m familiar with.',70862),
(97539,'The results are in, I\'ve got good news and bad news for you.$B$BOh, excuse me.',70862),
(97558,'Have you gathered the skin I inquired about? Our stocks are running low.$B$BIt may seem odd to ask for murloc skin but it works well for internal membranes, or surfaces like cheeks or mouths.$B$BSimilarly, the duskbat wing membranes are especially suited for more delicate areas, like faces or fingers. It prevents the skin from being too... thick.',70862),
(97583,'<The slime seems to regard you with interest.>',70790),
(97977,'Don\'t worry about any larger totems you might find. I wouldn\'t know what to do with them if you found a way to get them!',70790),
(98046,'How may I aid you?',70790),
(98065,'Please state your business. I have a city to run, and a people to lead.',70790),
(98069,'Have you been able to recover the supplies the harpies stole?',70862),
(98093,'There might be a chance to get down without them noticing me soon...',70862),
(98094,'Timing is everything...',70862),
(98248,'Good day, traveler. How can I assist?',70862),
(98251,'Once I get out of this place, I\'m never returning.',70862),
(98298,'Fangs, claws, gizzards. It makes no difference to me. The easiest way to study something is to see the guts yourself.',70862),
(98387,'Most of what you find will have been raided from Lakeshire anyway. It will do me good to know our people will thrive while the orcs wither.',70450),
(98389,'Have you freed the poor, unfortunate souls trapped in that cave?',70425),
(98404,'Ah, you have returned. I do hope you have brought the relics with you?',70790),
(98407,'A full assessment of the gnolls cannot be complete without facing the worst of their kind. Put those thrashers down!',70862),
(98417,'What have you found within the hills of our forest?',70450),
(98423,'What have you brought from the depths, $c.',70338),
(98545,'What\'s that? You say that Leonid sent you? Oh boy, haven\'t seen that crusty old soldier since Naxxramas was raining hell down on our heads.',70790),
(98575,'Ah, you received my message. Excellent. We orcs have a long and turbulent history with the entities of the Nether, but now we forge our own path, in command of our destiny. You, too, can seize the power to shape the future for your people. Where our leaders falter, we are ready to press forward and claim our rightful place. You will be of eminence among the trolls.',70790),
(98601,'Through pain comes resolve.',70334),
(98823,'Come. Seek and receive.',70862),
(99049,'Did you find her?',70840),
(99051,'Hopefully those snake scum aren\'t giving you trouble?',70862),
(99052,'Give \'em blood and thunder!',70862),
(99141,'You\'d best have those reports in hand, or get out of my face.',70862),
(99142,'More interruptions! Wait, it\'s you. Were you able to recover the tomb weed?',70790),
(99152,'You\'d best not be returning empty-handed. I either need the bones I asked for, or your body on a stretcher to confirm you at least gave it your all trying to get them.',70790),
(99153,'Did you find the damned thing?',70790),
(99156,'Have you dealt with our little problem?',70862),
(99196,'The Windshapers are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.$B$BA donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by the Windshapers for your generosity. $B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',70862);
